The '''Tower of Reconciliation''' was one of the four [[Council Towers|towers]] surrounding the [[Palace spire|Temple Spire]] atop the [[Imperial Palace|Jedi Temple]] on [[Coruscant]].<ref name="CL 2016" /> It was here that that the [[Council of Reconciliation]] would meet and work toward settling interplanetary dispute.<ref name="Star Wars Super Graphic: A Visual Guide to a Galaxy Far, Far Away">''[[Star Wars Super Graphic: A Visual Guide to a Galaxy Far, Far Away]]''</ref>

